		(property "Description" "3-axis magnetometer giving the antenna frame's heading. Without this, a GNSS fix cannot convert a frame-relative bearing into an absolute one. I2C, address 0x1C or 0x1E by SDO strap. Siting matters more than the part: keep well away from the DC-DC, the battery and any frame steel."
			(at 187.96 88.9 0)
