		(property "Description" "3-axis accelerometer. Primary job is tilt compensation for U10 -- a magnetometer only reads heading correctly when level, and this station is set down on varying terrain. Second job: detect the station being knocked or moved, which invalidates both the GNSS fix and the heading. I2C, address 0x18 or 0x19 by SDO strap."
